  "stageId": "main_04-08",
  "title": "ストレス反応",
  "storyCode": "4-8",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f4bff216bbcdf13a22222e539b9746cb41da4f04ed13e38102936708b2f2a490",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "撃つな、私だ。……そこにいるんだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "援軍を連れてきたぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "メテオリーテさん、私です！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "誰？　待って……まさか、アーミヤ！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "あなたが来てくれるなんて……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "すごく嬉しいし、心強いわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "――だけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "あなたは来るべきじゃなかった。これは向こうの罠なのよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "私たちを助けるためにあなたを危険にさらすのは、リスクが高すぎるわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "これは、判断としては間違いよ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "だが、どう見てもお前たちは逃げ切れそうにない状況だった。……この子がそれを知っていて、見捨てるわけがないだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "だから、今更アーミヤを責めても仕方がない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "責めてなんかないわ。ただ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "……ううん、やめておきましょう。……ごめんなさい、アーミヤ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "お気になさらず。お二人が無事で、本当に良かったです。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "……ありがとう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……ところで、ジェシカさんの様子が気になるんですが……彼女に何があったんでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うぅ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "それが……ちょっと、ショックで気が動転しちゃってるのよね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "本当は、自力で動けるようになるまで待とうと思ってたんだけど……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "この様子を見るに、精神的な傷が残ってる可能性もあるだろうし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……ジェシカさん、大丈夫ですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "こうなったら……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "フロストリーフさん、お願いがあります。ジェシカさんの手を私の腕に乗せて、握らせるように押さえておいてもらえませんか。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "……わかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ありがとうございます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……っ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "アーミヤ、大丈夫か！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "はい……！　ただ……これ、は……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "深い、悲しみ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "曖昧では、ありますが……それでも……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "――ジェシカさん！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "もう、大丈夫ですから……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "どうか、戻ってきてください……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……アーミヤ、さん……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "はい、アーミヤです！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……ほんとに……アーミヤさん、だ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "よかった……これで一安心ですね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "メテオリーテ",
      "speakerToken": "char_219_meteo_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_219_meteo",
      "portraitKey": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "……ジェシカ、大丈夫……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……わ、私……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "ごめんなさい……あんなの、想像すら……してなくて……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "いいえ、気にしないでください……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……私……あんな……う、ぅっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……あなたの感じたこと、私にはわかります。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "私も、以前には――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "逃げ出したいのに、足が動かない……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "叫びたいのに、声すら出せない……そんなことがありました。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "きっと、あなたも同じような経験をしたんですよね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……それでも、立ってください。ジェシカさん。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "怖がらずとも大丈夫です。私たちが、いつでもついていますから。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今のあなたは、一人ではありません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "一緒にロドスへ帰りましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "フランカさんとリスカムさんも待っていますしね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ジェシカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_259_Jessica_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "portraitKey": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "はい……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フロストリーフ",
      "speakerToken": "char_193_frostl_1",
      "operatorId": "char_193_frostl",
      "portraitKey": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "アーミヤ……今のは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……どうか、ケルシー先生には内緒にしておいてくださいね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
